# Paths scripts/public-check leaves alone, each with its reason. Anything else that matches stops a
# push. Prefer masking a value to adding a line here.

# Logs and records from before the check. They stay as they are: the owner's decision, 2026-11-03.
bench-results/2026-10-02-boot-time-vip/*
bench-results/2026-11-01-soak-pro-rt/*
bench-results/vip-card/*
bench-results/vip-spike/*
docs/pro.md
devices/common/tests/fixtures/diag/healthy-vip.json    # a real capture, kept as the test's input

